@startuml Obsidian_Sentinel_Enterprise_Architecture_v2_1_0 title Obsidian Sentinel WAF v2.1.0 - Enterprise Architecture (Real Implementation)
actor "Client Requests" as client cloud "Threat Intelligence (2041 Real Threats)" as threats cloud "MaxMind GeoIP2 Database" as geoip_db package "Obsidian Sentinel v2.1.0 (Single Go Binary)" as obsidian rectangle "Request ID Generation" rectangle "Security Headers (CSP, HSTS)" rectangle "256-Shard Rate Limiter (Zero Lock Contention)" rectangle "GeoIP Blocking Service (MaxMind)" rectangle "Multi-Feed Threat Intel (4 sources)" rectangle "Coraza WAF v3 Engine (59 rules)" rectangle "Enterprise Router & APIs (JWT, RBAC, Webhooks)" end package
database "PostgreSQL (Analytics)" as postgres database "Redis Cluster (Rate limit, cache)" as redis cloud "Monitoring: Prometheus/Grafana" as monitoring cloud "Alert Destinations: Slack/Teams/Discord/PagerDuty" as alerts
Client -> Request ID -> Security Headers -> Rate Limiter -> GeoIP -> Threat Intel -> WAF Engine -> Router
@enduml
